abstract: >-
  A fully specified reversible four-state block cellular automaton exactly
  conserves signed charge while allowing occupancy to change and exhibits
  delayed, density-dependent, irregular finite-time organisation. The release
  includes an additive withdrawal of the invalid v0.3.2 history-erasure causal
  headline after its endpoint failed under shuffled null geometry.
notes: >-
  Public code-and-evidence release accompanying the companion paper. The full
  development repository is retained privately by the author; large trajectories
  and checkpoints are not distributed.
repository-code: https://github.com/BartlettCJ/zws-reversible-coarsening
